{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/ca5c4cf193a36365fbd10999ab5d0657.avif?t=1770998296\" width=1560 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/9b3574b621989c7ee0437b8055f61579.poster.avif?t=1770998296\" width=800 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/9b3574b621989c7ee0437b8055f61579.webm?t=1770998296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/9b3574b621989c7ee0437b8055f61579.mp4?t=1770998296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Dive into a nonlinear exploration adventure filled with corrupted replicants,  robot uprising, brutal warmachines and more. Guide a lone replicant from a war-torn metropolis through dunes, forest and sea as you unveil the secrets of this cryptic world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/7cdb616fdd4cc344db21b002c89d7072.webp?t=1770998296\" width=1560 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>&quot;Inspired by the exploration of Environmental Station Alpha and the haunting atmosphere of INSIDE.&quot;</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/7b10b618a3777e206c932e3d8af262f1.avif?t=1770998296\" width=1560 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Explore the secrets buried deep within a vast, ruined world. Only atmosphere, curiosity and discovery.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/4479c93bc3a68366b415fe6952d2aed8.avif?t=1770998296\" width=1560 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Moving platforms, hidden mechanisms and long-term objectives that reveal themselves through exploration.\u00a0Nothing is explained. The world reveals itself as you learn to read it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/df8236e922b67ce477f65bedb093ff77.avif?t=1770998296\" width=1560 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Defeat a boss, take the long path or be a little more observant while exploring. Any corner can hide a secret and every secret can unlock a new ability.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/c7c4a5ed320fd1427f7b8f812d7cea4b.avif?t=1770998296\" width=1560 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Corrupted replicants, corrupted machines, ruthless bosses and who knows what else...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;Accessible combat focusing on atmosphere and discovery over punishing difficulty.&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>\u300b</i>No text or speech used for gameplay guidance\u00a0<i> \u300bNavigate the UI by interpreting international symbols</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/7cdb616fdd4cc344db21b002c89d7072.webp?t=1770998296\" width=1560 height=48 /></span><strong>&quot;<i>A labor of love crafted by a solo developer over 10 years.\u00a0SELINI has been a journey of wild dreams, hard lessons and relentless self-growth.</i>&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1434050/extras/acb791564bfe63f12f81a53da0002aa9.avif?t=1770998296\" width=1560 height=100 /></span>  </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Witness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1434050/da1312a64c3043ab4908dc39895380eebe8f9d1d.jpg"},{"name":"Catalyst","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1434050/354520b3e31cfdbaa30887ae25b52879e2ed4376.jpg"},{"name":"Graftmother","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1434050/6f2da32ac11797ab697871d140301d8d74904e59.jpg"},{"name":"Reignite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1434050/fa9b627f3c7619dad1580777eb22e0cdd51a28f3.jpg"},{"name":"Venerate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1434050/8e734453c5075b5186685bbfe876b3b672a589ae.jpg"},{"name":"Silvanthropos","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1434050/ea12c305abc2650febd80a95853463d0e90f2ce6.jpg"},{"name":"Nullcube","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1434050/afeeb4a703affc705280fc2ef6278c7488e2e254.jpg"},{"name":"Tenebrous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com